{"id":"b75200f005282ddf","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ppt.md","title":"df-ppt (Probabilistic Polynomial-Time Algorithms)","display":"df-ppt (Probabilistic Polynomial-Time Algorithms)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-ppt (Probabilistic Polynomial-Time Algorithms)","label":"28-df-ppt","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-ppt","PPT","Probabilistic Polynomial-Time Algorithms"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","[[28-df-computation]]"],"source_book_location":"§7.1, §7.4.2 and Definition 9.14; printed pp.125–126,133,187; PDF pp.151–152,159,213","source_printed_pages":"125–126,133,187","source_pdf_pages":"151–152,159,213","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ppt (Probabilistic Polynomial-Time Algorithms)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ppt"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ppt</span><span>PPT</span><span>Probabilistic Polynomial-Time Algorithms</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§7.1, §7.4.2 and Definition 9.14; printed pp.125–126,133,187; PDF pp.151–152,159,213"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125–126,133,187"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"151–152,159,213"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为确定型输出机，在配对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\)</span> 上的输出、运行时间记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\">\\(M(x;r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\)</span>。时间和输出编码采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_t\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_t\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 的固定元数右结合编码，单比特串与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 认同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 为可数集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 表示其概率质量函数集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Sigma^*\\to\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(A:\\Sigma^*\\to\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布。</li>\n<li>为期望时间算法，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(r\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为无限随机带，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是独立公平比特的乘积概率测度，即每个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的前缀柱集测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-j}\">\\(2^{-j}\\)</span>；随机带坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(r_0,r_1,\\ldots)\">\\(r=(r_0,r_1,\\ldots)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(M_0,M_1)\">\\(N=(M_0,M_1)\\)</span> 为两台共享 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\">\\(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\)</span> 和带数、仅转移函数可不同的确定型机。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}\\)</span>、初始配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^0_{M_0,x}\">\\(C^0_{M_0,x}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C.q\">\\(C.q\\)</span> 是状态投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C.T_1\">\\(C.T_1\\)</span> 是输出工作带投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}\">\\(\\operatorname{out}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTM}\">\\(\\mathsf{RTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_t^N\">\\(C_t^N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_N\">\\(T_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_N\">\\(O_N\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_N\">\\(T_N\\)</span> 取值于该序集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 是最坏情形多项式时间随机算法类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{EPPT}\">\\(\\mathbf{EPPT}\\)</span> 是总概率停机且期望多项式时间随机算法类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(Z)\">\\(\\mathcal L(Z)\\)</span> 为给定值域上的概率质量函数；在概率式中使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x)\">\\(A(x)\\)</span> 表示按其质量函数抽样。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是取值于当前可数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 的随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\Omega\">\\(z\\in\\Omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A(x_1,\\ldots,x_t)\\coloneqq A(\\operatorname{tup}_t(x_1,\\ldots,x_t))\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ x_1,\\ldots,x_t\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A(x_1,\\ldots,x_t)\\coloneqq A(\\operatorname{tup}_t(x_1,\\ldots,x_t))\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ x_1,\\ldots,x_t\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M_0,M_1)\\in\\mathrm{TM}^2: (Q_0,\\Sigma_0,\\Gamma_0,q_{0,0},q_{\\mathrm{acc},0},q_{\\mathrm{rej},0},k_{M_0})=(Q_1,\\Sigma_1,\\Gamma_1,q_{0,1},q_{\\mathrm{acc},1},q_{\\mathrm{rej},1},k_{M_1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M_0,M_1)\\in\\mathrm{TM}^2: (Q_0,\\Sigma_0,\\Gamma_0,q_{0,0},q_{\\mathrm{acc},0},q_{\\mathrm{rej},0},k_{M_0})=(Q_1,\\Sigma_1,\\Gamma_1,q_{0,1},q_{\\mathrm{acc},1},q_{\\mathrm{rej},1},k_{M_1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_0^N(x,r)\\coloneqq C^0_{M_0,x},\\qquad C_{t+1}^N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C_t^N(x,r)&amp;C_t^N(x,r).q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\ \\iota C&#39;\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{M_{r_t}}(C_t^N(x,r),C&#39;)&amp;C_t^N(x,r).q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_0^N(x,r)\\coloneqq C^0_{M_0,x},\\qquad C_{t+1}^N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C_t^N(x,r)&amp;C_t^N(x,r).q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\ \\iota C&#39;\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{M_{r_t}}(C_t^N(x,r),C&#39;)&amp;C_t^N(x,r).q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\min\\bigl(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:C_t^N(x,r).q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\min\\bigl(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:C_t^N(x,r).q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{out}(C_{T_N(x,r)}^N(x,r).T_1)&amp;T_N(x,r)&lt;\\infty,\\\\ \\uparrow&amp;T_N(x,r)=\\infty.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{out}(C_{T_N(x,r)}^N(x,r).T_1)&amp;T_N(x,r)&lt;\\infty,\\\\ \\uparrow&amp;T_N(x,r)=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{z\\in\\Omega}p(z)=1\\},\\qquad \\mathcal L(Z)(z)\\coloneqq\\Pr[Z=z].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{z\\in\\Omega}p(z)=1\\},\\qquad \\mathcal L(Z)(z)\\coloneqq\\Pr[Z=z].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[A(x)=z]\\coloneqq A(x)(z)\\qquad(x,z\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[A(x)=z]\\coloneqq A(x)(z)\\qquad(x,z\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\left[\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ A(x)(z)=2^{-c(|x|+1)^b}\\left|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}:M(x;r)=z\\}\\right|\\right]\\land\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\left[\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ A(x)(z)=2^{-c(|x|+1)^b}\\left|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}:M(x;r)=z\\}\\right|\\right]\\land\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\nu\\{r:T_N(x,r)&lt;\\infty\\}=1\\land\\mathbb E_{r\\leftarrow\\nu}T_N(x,r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land \\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ A(x)(z)=\\nu\\{r:O_N(x,r)=z\\}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\nu\\{r:T_N(x,r)&lt;\\infty\\}=1\\land\\mathbb E_{r\\leftarrow\\nu}T_N(x,r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land \\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ A(x)(z)=\\nu\\{r:O_N(x,r)=z\\}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PPT 的有限随机带长度和时间界对所有随机串统一成立，含安全参数的输入按规范配对编码。EPPT 以两个转移表逐步读取在线公平随机比特；配置递归按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 良基展开，非停机配置的唯一后继由确定性保证，停机配置保持不变。EPPT 单列，供书中定义 9.14 的期望时间模拟器使用；PPT 算法属于 EPPT，但逆向不能按同一个算法强制成立。预言机或交互算法的时间约束必须在相应节点另行绑定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 为确定型输出机，在配对输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上的输出、运行时间记为 $M(x;r)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)$。时间和输出编码采用 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。$\\operatorname{tup}_t$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的固定元数右结合编码，单比特串与 $0,1$ 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5