"display":false},{"tex":"A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"A(x_1,\\ldots,x_t)\\coloneqq A(\\operatorname{tup}_t(x_1,\\ldots,x_t))\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ x_1,\\ldots,x_t\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M_0,M_1)\\in\\mathrm{TM}^2: (Q_0,\\Sigma_0,\\Gamma_0,q_{0,0},q_{\\mathrm{acc},0},q_{\\mathrm{rej},0},k_{M_0})=(Q_1,\\Sigma_1,\\Gamma_1,q_{0,1},q_{\\mathrm{acc},1},q_{\\mathrm{rej},1},k_{M_1})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"C_0^N(x,r)\\coloneqq C^0_{M_0,x},\\qquad C_{t+1}^N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C_t^N(x,r)&C_t^N(x,r).q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\ \\iota C'\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{M_{r_t}}(C_t^N(x,r),C')&C_t^N(x,r).q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"T_N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\min\\bigl(\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:C_t^N(x,r).q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"O_N(x,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{out}(C_{T_N(x,r)}^N(x,r).T_1)&T_N(x,r)<\\infty,\\\\ \\uparrow&T_N(x,r)=\\infty.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]:\\sum_{z\\in\\Omega}p(z)=1\\},\\qquad \\mathcal L(Z)(z)\\coloneqq\\Pr[Z=z].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr[A(x)=z]\\coloneqq A(x)(z)\\qquad(x,z\\in\\Sigma^*).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\left[\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ A(x)(z)=2^{-c(|x|+1)^b}\\left|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}:M(x;r)=z\\}\\right|\\right]\\land\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbf{EPPT}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RTM}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\nu\\{r:T_N(x,r)<\\infty\\}=1\\land\\mathbb E_{r\\leftarrow\\nu}T_N(x,r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land \\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ A(x)(z)=\\nu\\{r:O_N(x,r)=z\\}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":4811,"backlinks":[{"id":"3341b97427794006","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$T(n)\\ge n+1$；$\\mathsf{RTM},T_N,O_N,\\nu$ 使用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的两个转移表与无限公平随机带语义；$\\chi_L$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]。"},{"id":"71fe8c583a58e15f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀随机多项式时间的一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。"},{"id":"c88d34f9d8f9da3a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{Dist}$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]。"},{"id":"46982b39fb15e783","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$I$ 为非空可数索引集；$\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)$、$\\mathcal L$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]。"},{"id":"b191494d56cdc254","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$；$\\operatorname{Dist}$、$\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-min-entropy]]。$A\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n$，$\\mathbf1_A(x)$ 为集合指示函数。"},{"id":"5c4afc9766080d5a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀的一比特输出预测器，输入为 $(1^n,f(x))$，二输入采用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的已定义配对接口；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]；$U_n$ 为 $\\Sigma^n$ 上均匀分布，$A$ 的随机性独立于 $x$。"},{"id":"278046f9a093bf22","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{View}_V^